---
# Shared variables such as alert_payload, expected_target, and snow_* are an
# intentional contract between the playbook, roles, and the AWX credential that
# injects snow_url/snow_user/snow_password. Prefixing them per role would break
# that contract, so the role-prefix naming rule is skipped for this project.
skip_list:
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
